From 57a44e90d011bc51968abbdab20161c278a543f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:47:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add skill cooldown HUD: two circles (Q/E) that fill as
 cooldowns run

- New SkillCooldownHUD (skill_cooldown_hud.gd), created in MatchManager._build_hud.
  Each circle fills clockwise from 12 o'clock, shows seconds left, and turns green
  with the key letter when the skill is ready. Skill names are shown underneath.
- Player.start_cd(slot, secs) replaces direct writes to cd[]: it records the cooldown
  length (cd_max) and syncs it to the owning player via net_cd, so clients (not just
  the host) see the correct cooldown. Clients count it down locally between syncs.
- Oven Mitt Armor's cooldown reduction and the Skewer no-target refund also sync.
- Player.cd_fill(slot) returns 0..1 for the HUD.
